      "writtenOn": "2021-06-24T02:39:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m a bit confused by this. The full duplex mode was explicitly added to the USB SPI protocol for the chip/g implementation. It\u0027s one of the few additions from this protocol that wasn\u0027t originally present in the other.\n\nIt looks like this was one of the requirements with the mn50 implementation.\n\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/437627/",
