      "writtenOn": "2021-06-22T23:50:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should be either USB_SPI_READ_COUNT_INVALID or USB_SPI_WRITE_COUNT_INVALID not 0x8004. Actually this error didn\u0027t exist before so should really be a new error code USB_SPI_READ_WRITE_COUNT_INVALID \u003d 0x000A.",
